    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d128">

                <pb facs="0262" n="250" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg250"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">845.00/4–2445: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Secretary of State,
                        at San Francisco</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-04-24">April 24, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>30. We understand that Wavell is expected back in Delhi on May 1st and would
                    presumably leave London not later than the 27th. Consequently, <pb facs="0263"
                        n="251" xml:id="pg251"/> if you desire to speak to Eden along the lines of
                    Phillips’ suggestion, it would have to be done now, otherwise the opportunity
                    will be lost.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
